  "protocol": "1200 modeled steps. Imposed flexion-phase excitation and inhibition from steps 50 to 1049; 2\u201312 upstream neurons fire during ten of each fifteen steps. Tilt cue(s) supplied from 300 to 899 every 1 or 3 steps. REST imposed from 1050. Summaries exclude onset/settling intervals.",
